| `shm_page_get()` :335 | **copy + 2 edits** | Fills P5:119. (1) `flush_tlb_all()` at :356 → `local_flush_tlb_all()`. (2) needs `SHM_VA_BEGIN 0x1000` / `SHM_VA_END 0xf000` defines (add to mm.c or mm.h). Window is still valid: `user_riscv.lds` is byte-identical between P4/P5 with `. = 0x10000;`, so the first user PT_LOAD still starts at `0xf000`. Exercised by `test/echo.c` (`SHMP_KEY 0x42`, 2064-byte struct → 1 page). |
